{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_225_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_225","textTraditional":"一、十有三年。春，齊侯、衞侯次于垂瑕。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_225_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_225","textTraditional":"二、夏，築蛇淵囿。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_225_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_225","textTraditional":"三、大蒐于比蒲。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_225_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_225","textTraditional":"四、衞公孟彄帥師伐曹。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_225_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_225","textTraditional":"五、秋，晉趙鞅入于晉陽以叛。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_225_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_225","textTraditional":"六、冬，晉荀寅及士吉射入于朝歌以叛。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_225_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_225","textTraditional":"七、晉趙鞅歸于晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_225_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_225","textTraditional":"此叛也，其言歸何？以地正國也。其以地正國奈何？晉趙鞅取晉陽之甲以逐荀寅與士吉射。荀寅與士吉射者，曷為者也？君側之惡人也。此逐君側之惡人，曷為以叛言之？無君命也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_225_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_225","textTraditional":"八、薛弒其君比。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}